# SPIKE 2026-11-06, option A: pull-only mirror of each provider account into a
# local Maildir that Dovecot shows as Live/<address>/. Nothing here writes to the
# provider: Sync Pull only. Local actions reach the provider through the replay.
IMAPAccount contact
Host mail.privateemail.com
Port 993
TLSType IMAPS
User contact@aptero.co
PassCmd "cat /mirror/contact.pass"
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt
PipelineDepth 10

IMAPStore contact-remote
Account contact

MaildirStore contact-local
Path /srv/vmail/admin/live/contact/
Inbox /srv/vmail/admin/live/contact/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel contact
Far :contact-remote:
Near :contact-local:
Patterns *
Create Near
Remove None
Expunge Near
Sync Pull
# state lives inside each local folder: wiping a folder wipes its state too
SyncState *
CopyArrivalDate yes
